// to_date accepts 1, 2, or 3 arguments; this 5-arg call must be rejected by arity
// validation. Regression for #2: dialect conversion functions (to_date/to_time/
// to_timestamp/to_interval) must carry a FunctionSignature per arity, otherwise
// FunctionRegistry.collides evicts the canonical signature and FunctionValidator
// skips all arity checks (the call would then only fail at render time).
FIND orders o
FETCH to_date(o.order_date, o.order_date, o.order_date, o.order_date, o.order_date)
